ama__ng/status/1573614200811036672\nhttps://twitter.com/yama__ng/status/1570715170548383753/photo/1\nhttps://twitter.com/yama__ng/status/1541442210495102976\nhttps://twitter.com/yama__ng/status/1591014478141095936\n\nPlease draw something beautiful or cute :-)\nYou may wear a bunny suit, your regular clothes, or design a new outfit. Pose, composition and background are your choice.\n\nBe confident and smug about your beauty.\n\nThe gradient at the end of her hair is a charm. Don't forget the fox ears, tail, and feathers.\n\nThank you very much.", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [{"path": "/@ZAU5_5/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2494871, "client_id": 2440096, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0979a4f2/uploads/origins/a0b9020a-6d54-40fb-889a-bf0c5f193384?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2dcce31f839bb05e7edcf54a30c490dc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0979a4f2/uploads/origins/a0b9020a-6d54-40fb-889a-bf0c5f193384?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2dcce31f839bb05e7edcf54a30c490dc, https://si.imgix.net/0979a4f2/uploads/origins/a0b9020a-6d54-40fb-889a-bf0c5f193384?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc87d04b8b2efb1e60caf745d00b6cfc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0979a4f2/uploads/origins/a0b9020a-6d54-40fb-889a-bf0c5f193384?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3dec7c87dc0721b306b067613b4e4089 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0979a4f2/uploads/origins/a0b9020a-6d54-40fb-889a-bf0c5f193384?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2838ddb3fa73f303adc1b3c27421a723", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0979a4f2/